zxkit (1.0.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add a manual page for zxmedia, and ship the zxkit-mc-setup one from the
    source tree (tools/mc) instead of debian/, so every installation has both.

 -- BogDan Vatra <bogdan@kde.org>  Sat, 07 Nov 2026 12:03:24 +0200

zxkit (1.0.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add the zxkit-mc package for Midnight Commander 4.8.29 and later (the
    mc.ext.ini 4.0 format): the extfs helper is installed in Debian's MC
    directory, /usr/lib/mc/extfs.d, and zxkit-mc-setup adds the file
    associations to a user's mc.ext.ini.
  * Move the Midnight Commander files out of zxkit-tools; zxkit-mc replaces
    the old /usr/share/zxkit/mc/zxkit.ini.
  * Run the MC integration tests during the build and add the mc-layout
    autopkgtest.
  * Add a manual page for zxkit-mc-setup.

 -- BogDan Vatra <bogdan@kde.org>  Sat, 07 Nov 2026 11:37:22 +0200

